ery from Eternal Towers of Hell (EToH).\n\nThe goal is to have 50 towers in each area of the game.","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-545678fbfd9cc80f683224a4aade5aae/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d93ede7672dd39a3abf00b5c729b856e/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fbb92de6480fdac7d0b7150b108d28f8/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}